AX835 is a high-performance, high-speed 11ax indoor dual-band ceiling AP that can provide 2.4G (40MHz channel width) and 5.8GHz (160 MHz) dual-band wireless services. 2.4G provides up to 574Mbps access rate, and 5G provides up to 2402Mbps access rate. Supports two power supply modes: 48V PoE and DC 12V.
Manufactured in two different form factors (square and round). Available 2023 on Aliexpress under the KuWfi brand as "KuWFi 3000Mbps Ceiling AP" (Model: AX835). 

