==== OEM installation via sysupgrade ====

  - Download the **sysupgrade** image.
  - Rename the file extension from .bin to .ubin.
  - Proceed with firmware upgrade via the stock image.

==== OEM installation via TFTP ====
-> [[docs:guide-user:installation:generic.flashing|Generic instructions]]

-> [[docs:guide-user:installation:generic.flashing.tftp|TFTP-specific instructions]]


=== Option 1: ===
 
  - Connect to the router using an ethernet cable
  - Spin up a TFTP server serving the install/kernel file above
  - Open the case and attach an [[toh:yuncore:ax835#serial|UART]]
  - Attach power to the router and interrupt the countdown by pressing any key
  - Boot kernel image via TFTP 
  - Backup stock image using your preferred method, download backups
  - Flash the upgrade image using your preferred method

=== Option 2: ===
  -  Connect to the router using an ethernet cable
  -  Spin up a TFTP server serving the upgrade image above
  -  Open the case and attach an [[toh:yuncore:ax835#serial|UART]]
  -  Attach power to the router and interrupt the countdown by pressing any key
  -  Select option 2 (Upgrade firmware)
  -  Enter IP address information and image name
  -  Wait patiently
