===== Specific Configuration =====

==== Network interfaces ====

Since the device uses DSA, only the ''wan'' and ''lan'' interfaces should be used.

==== Switch Ports ====

^ Port             ^ Switch port   ^
| 1Gbps LAN                    |  3  |
| 1Gbps WAN (with 802.3af PoE) |  4  |
| 2.5Gbps CPU port (internal)  |  6  |


